{"id": "34416", "title": "我有个火爆老公", "author": "辰晞", "category": "文学名著", "count": 39, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34416.htm", "intro": "讨厌！大家都觉得她没用，只能待在家里当米虫，她就偏要出去找个工作，向家人证明她也是有点能力的——可恶！为什么连试了那么多间公司，就是没有一家肯用她！？‘我愿意雇用你。’太好了！眼前这个又高又帅的老板，竟然说他愿意雇用她，他真是个好心的人！为了感谢他，她决定上班第一天便去找他道谢——呜……怎么会这样？她只是去道个谢，没想到竟然连初吻都没了！？", "base": "files/article/html/34/34416", "chapters": [{"title": "序言", "file": "2184955.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2184956.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2184957.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2184958.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2184959.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2184960.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2184961.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2184962.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2184963.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2184964.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2184965.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2184966.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2184967.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2184968.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2184969.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2184970.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2184971.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2184972.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2184973.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2184974.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2184975.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2184976.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2184977.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2184978.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2184979.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第25页", "file"